y%20Bank\">Piggy Bank</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Boots%20of%20Haste\">Boots of Haste</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-See_also\">See also</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Villa Scapula Library</li>\n<li>Loot/Villa Scapula</li></ul></div>","quests":["black-knight-quest","secret-service-quest"]}